        "notes": "The story in Lymph City Blues focuses on a murder mystery and the player will be tasked with putting together clues that help solve it. The player may be exposed to descriptions of clues or events that could be disturbing, even if in a non-human-world setting. The setting also takes place in the immune system, so be aware that while the story doesn't go in-depth about issues that could arise in the immune system, it may contain situations that are inspired by the immune response."
